"},{"path":"get/media/eyes/eye-ikoko.webp","sha":"a819b9655a9a55dd586f9d0e6a6edf452de1bcf1","base64":""},{"path":"get/media/eyes/eye-mirmi.webp","sha":"d36513f7e8229ba17b94cb7dc50e6e2ffe77f94c","base64":""},{"path":"get/media/eyes/eye-wrena.webp","sha":"3a96ca4767cf67d6fb357f44536e454bed7f8774","base64":""},{"path":"get/media/eyes/eye-osis.webp","sha":"1fa44fea3d275ebedc04a496a085c3226d32b701","base64":""},{"path":"get/media/eyes/eye-kako.webp","sha":"97d68468022a1e440f103cb876f0fc51ea82f46e","base64":""},{"path":"get/media/trailer/eyes-trailer-captions.vtt","sha":"c2324780831c3dd1bde66cd2beef7c2bc196fbdc","content":"WEBVTT\n\n00:00.700 --> 00:06.800\n[quiet, airy music \u00b7 three small lights drift in the dark]\n\n00:06.900 --> 00:09.500\nWhat if your phone had a life of its own?\n\n00:09.600 --> 00:16.700\nNo two are alike. [soft plucked melody \u00b7 small creature sounds]\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:21.500\nIt lives on your home screen.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:28.700\nIt notices. [a quiet heartbeat while it charges]\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:31.100\nIt becomes what you need. [glassy transformation sounds]\n\n00:43.300 --> 00:45.500\nA whole arcade inside your Eye. [energetic chiptune music]\n\n00:57.700 --> 01:01.000\nYou are not alone. [warm pulses and sparkles]\n\n01:09.700 --> 01:13.300\nA creature of your own.\n\n01:13.500 --> 01:16.700\nNo feeding. No streaks. No punishment.\n\n01:20.400 --> 01:26.400\nEYES \u00b7 Your phone. Your creature. Your EYE.\nAvailable for Android and iPhone.\n"},{"path":"get/media/trailer/trailer-poster.webp","sha":"b48ce6eda6beafff01c6a0b61a789d13dac7429d","base64":""},{"path":"get/media/home/folder.webp","sha":"bc4c2b0443b0d43ce43061dee16bc5995b06404b","base64":""},{"path":"get/media/home/drawer.webp","sha":"14450a5988896648dace6bdd85096dc95dfd31bf","base64":""},{"path":"get/media/home/charging.webp","sha":"27daf25363b7ed8369469eac522c6aa3ff4af86b","base64":""},{"path":"get/media/home/home.webp","sha":"ba83570d4401a408000750c8f25803285f2f3404","base64":""},{"path":"get/media/home/music.webp","sha":"b0f74e74a39a46268d8b66d7da21aea925c6ba30","base64":""},{"path":"get/media/contact/exchange.webp","sha":"a4696b7282c8f842a60570958d854b4ddbadc1ae","base64":""},{"path":"get/media/contact/hangout.webp","sha":"f0bc882cce2d339cbcdb04920e58f17219014a45","base64":""},{"path":"get/media/contact/meet.webp","sha":"9213f6786c5d81a8bf893a58ce19acb21ad279b4","base64":""},{"path":"get/media/contact/history.webp","sha":"842ed1fdc4eebbf735108612ea8fffafd91182c6","base64":""},{"path":"get/media/contact/duel.webp","sha":"ac87908460d41bde1bb3dffe654787a0a14b8c17","base64":""},{"path":"get/media/abilities/play.webp","sha":"b6763913510be35492151e0c780e97ab71dfe6d8","base64":""},{"path":"get/media/abilities/weather.mp4","sha":"d8a059e7b46c90a649f41d06e16063ebb6a5d50c","base64":""},{"path":"get/media/abilities/vision.webp","sha":"6e2c0609331777feedc3331bdf5a709a408dec10","base64":""},{"path":"get/media/abilities/arcade.mp4","sha":"911b034e1107165c476b0d37720e9910dd4ae6f1","base64":""},{"path":"get/media/abilities/play.mp4","sha":"b92574f0d60518baa289314f24d004b1823d2c8c","base64":"